OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAdrian Dunbar on home, Irish unity
OL,4,Aand his new Line of Duty catchphrase
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom the abattoir to AC-12. One of
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland's best known and most
OL,8,Fsuccessful actors, Adrian Dunbar, is
OL,9,Ffiercely proud of his Ulster roots
OL,10,Fwhich he said have shaped his life, his
OL,11,Fcareer and his politics.
OL,13,FEven his most famous role - Supt Ted
OL,14,FHastings who runs the fictional
OL,15,Fanti-corruption unit AC-12 in the BBC
OL,16,Fdrama Line of Duty - owes much to his
OL,17,FFermanagh heritage.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
