OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAdrian Dunbar on home, Irish unity
OL,4,Aand his new Line of Duty catchphrase
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen times got tough in his career he
OL,7,Freminded himself of when he had made
OL,8,Fends meet heaving bags of salt in
OL,9,Ffreezing temperatures in an Enniskillen
OL,10,Fabattoir.
OL,12,FBut that was all a long time ago. Fresh
OL,13,Ffrom filming the much-anticipated
OL,14,Fseventh series of the hit TV show
OL,15,Fthat's made him a household name, he
OL,16,Fagreed to talk politics.
